@startuml
title Step 5 - Deployment State Machine
hide empty description

state "Created / Validating\n(execution only)" as CREATED
state "Rejected\n(no row)" as REJECTED
state "Awaiting Confirmation\n(AWAITING_CONFIRMATION)" as AWAITING
state "Queued\n(QUEUED)" as QUEUED
state "Running\n(RUNNING)" as RUNNING
state "Submitted\n(SUBMITTED)" as SUBMITTED
state "Failed\n(FAILED)" as FAILED

[*] --> CREATED : createDeployment
CREATED --> AWAITING : validate/build/plan/fingerprint success\n/ persist deployment
CREATED --> REJECTED : invalid input / rollback
REJECTED --> [*]

AWAITING --> AWAITING : confirmDeployment [invalid override]\n/ validation error; no job
AWAITING --> AWAITING : confirmDeployment [PLAN_CHANGED]\n/ refresh fingerprint; no job
AWAITING --> QUEUED : confirmDeployment [match; valid; CAS]\n/ atomic lifecycle+record+job insert; return 202
QUEUED --> RUNNING : worker claims leased job
RUNNING --> RUNNING : recordDeploymentStep\n(INFRASTRUCTURE_READY / CONFIGURATION_RESOLVED / MANIFEST_GENERATED)
RUNNING --> FAILED : PLAN_STALE_AFTER_ACCEPT [fingerprint mismatch]\n/ fail INFRASTRUCTURE_READY before external side effects
RUNNING --> SUBMITTED : CD publish accepted\n/ save delivery reference/status and lifecycle
RUNNING --> FAILED : terminal execution failure\n/ persist error and failed internal step when applicable
SUBMITTED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]

note right of QUEUED
  The durable execution job is a transactional outbox.
  Retry of the same idempotency key returns the same tracking id.
end note
note right of RUNNING
  Exactly three internal steps are persisted. Worker rebuilds the typed plan
  and verifies accepted fingerprint before external side effects.
end note
note bottom of SUBMITTED
  delivery_status is separate from lifecycle status.
  UC-04 derives CD_SYNCED and APPLICATION_READY live and never writes.
end note
@enduml
